<td id="S4.T1.2.1.8.1" class="ltx_td ltx_align_left" style="padding-left:4.0pt;padding-right:4.0pt;">§<a href="#S4.SS6" title="4.6 Product Recommender ‣ 4 Case Studies ‣ Design Patterns for Securing LLM Agentsagainst Prompt Injections" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_tag">4.6</span></a></td>
